{"seq":4,"slug":"major-works","title":"香农·major-works","stage":"DONE","category":"claude-shannon","categoryLabel":"香农","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/major-works","rating":{"composite":3.9,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/19_claude-shannon/4_major-works","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"代表成就\">代表成就</h1><p>本卷聚焦香农<strong>笔下的具体著作</strong>——逐篇拆解他写了哪些划时代的论文、每篇说了什么、为何重要。三章依重要性与年代展开：一九四八年的《通信的数学理论》创立信息论；一九三七年的硕士论文奠定数字电路；密码学、计算机下棋等前瞻成果归入「其他成果」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>本卷以「<strong>作品</strong>」为单位，回答「这篇论文写了什么、怎么论证、留下什么」。它与同人物下的其他兄弟 hub 视角不同：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>：以「贡献/学科」为单位（信息论、布尔逻辑、密码学各是什么），本卷则落到承载这些贡献的<strong>具体文本</strong>。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>：讲香农的思维方式（抽象、同构、玩中求解），本卷讲这些方法<strong>结晶成的论文</strong>。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a>：讲作品在后世的回响，本卷讲作品<strong>本身的内容</strong>。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a> / <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>：人物与评价，本卷只谈作品。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话：<strong>别处讲「香农是谁、贡献了什么、影响多大」，本卷讲「香农写下的那几篇文章本身」。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[1948 论文·其文&lt;br/&gt;信息论内核] --&gt; B[1948 论文·里程碑&lt;br/&gt;影响史]&#10;  C[硕士论文·布尔代数] --&gt; D[硕士论文·最重要]&#10;  A --&gt; E[密码学与保密]&#10;  A --&gt; F[计算与游戏]&#10;  C -.早 11 年.-&gt; A\">flowchart LR\n  A[1948 论文·其文&lt;br/&gt;信息论内核] --&gt; B[1948 论文·里程碑&lt;br/&gt;影响史]\n  C[硕士论文·布尔代数] --&gt; D[硕士论文·最重要]\n  A --&gt; E[密码学与保密]\n  A --&gt; F[计算与游戏]\n  C -.早 11 年.-&gt; A</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>前置</strong>：熟悉概率与对数有助于读懂熵公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H=-\\sum p_i\\log_2 p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；了解基本逻辑运算（与/或/非）有助于读懂硕士论文。无背景者可先读各篇的散文段，跳过公式。</li>\n<li><strong>建议顺序</strong>：先 <a href=\"the-masters-thesis/boolean-algebra-and-switching\">硕士论文·布尔代数</a>（年代最早、最易入门）→ <a href=\"the-1948-paper/a-mathematical-theory-of-communication\">1948 论文·其文</a>（核心）→ 其余各篇按兴趣。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"篇目索引\">篇目索引</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章</th>\n<th>篇</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td><a href=\"the-1948-paper/a-mathematical-theory-of-communication\">《通信的数学理论》其文</a></td>\n<td>熵、信道容量、两大编码定理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td><a href=\"the-1948-paper/a-landmark-paper\">一篇里程碑式的论文</a></td>\n<td>论文的传播与跨领域影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td><a href=\"the-masters-thesis/boolean-algebra-and-switching\">布尔代数与开关电路</a></td>\n<td>逻辑↔电路的同构、化简方法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td><a href=\"the-masters-thesis/the-most-important-thesis\">最重要的硕士论文</a></td>\n<td>评价出处、获奖与含金量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td><a href=\"other-works/cryptography-and-secrecy\">密码学与保密</a></td>\n<td>完美保密、一次性密码本、混淆与扩散</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td><a href=\"other-works/computing-and-games\">计算与游戏</a></td>\n<td>计算机下棋框架、机械鼠忒修斯</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-1948-paper","title":"一九四八年论文","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/major-works/the-1948-paper","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-mathematical-theory-of-communication","title":"《通信的数学理论》其文","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/major-works/the-1948-paper/a-mathematical-theory-of-communication"},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-landmark-paper","title":"一篇里程碑式的论文","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/major-works/the-1948-paper/a-landmark-paper"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-masters-thesis","title":"硕士论文","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/major-works/the-masters-thesis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"boolean-algebra-and-switching","title":"布尔代数与开关电路","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/major-works/the-masters-thesis/boolean-algebra-and-switching"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-most-important-thesis","title":"最重要的硕士论文","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/major-works/the-masters-thesis/the-most-important-thesis"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"other-works","title":"其他成果","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/major-works/other-works","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cryptography-and-secrecy","title":"密码学与保密","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/major-works/other-works/cryptography-and-secrecy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"computing-and-games","title":"计算与游戏","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/major-works/other-works/computing-and-games"}]}]}